[Unit]
Description=Nightly image auto-update
Documentation=file:///home/buntu/Projects/README.md#image-auto-update

[Timer]
# Inside the 03:55-04:45 maintenance window: after the 04:05 new-files scan (done about 04:11), finished before fastpi pulls the result at 04:20. A night asleep is skipped. Never a wake of its own.
OnCalendar=*-*-* 04:12:00
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
